    m.REC_REFRESH_AT,
    -- multi-active satellites on CLAIM_BK (SAT_MOTOR_AUG_CLAIM_BENEFIT_HEAD, SAT_MOTOR_AUG_CLAIM_BILL_LINE, SAT_MOTOR_AUG_CLAIM_DOC_CHECKLIST, SAT_MOTOR_AUG_CLAIM_PROVIDER_BILLING, SAT_MOTOR_AUG_CLAIM_REOPEN, SAT_MOTOR_AUG_CLAIM_SUB_FILE, SAT_CLAIM_PROVIDER_BILLING, SAT_CLAIM_RESERVE_HEAD, SAT_LNK_CLAIM_PARTY_ROLE):
    -- one load time per CLAIM_BK, the newest REC_REFRESH_AT of the rows carrying any of their data;
    -- all child rows of a parent share it (ma_sat finds its latest set by time).
